1
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:12,320
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:15,800
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:18,480
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:21,680
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:25,800
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:29,280
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:32,200
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:35,400
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:39,400
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:42,600
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:45,320
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:48,680
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:56,720 --> 00:00:59,000
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:00,400
=Episode 19=

15
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:07,840
(Minor Perfection Realm, Stage 9)

16
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:08,799
This is...

17
00:01:10,159 --> 00:01:11,280
the Minor Perfection Realm,

18
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:12,719
Stage 9!

19
00:01:14,480 --> 00:01:17,079
Is this really your limit?

20
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:23,280
Master was right.

21
00:01:23,959 --> 00:01:26,280
To advance further in cultivation,

22
00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:28,280
you still need the right opportunity.

23
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:30,079
Without the right opportunity,

24
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:32,079
however many resources you have,

25
00:01:32,319 --> 00:01:33,560
they won't do you any good.

26
00:01:34,840 --> 00:01:36,319
What a shame.

27
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:41,079
Thanks for your generosity, Senior.

28
00:01:41,480 --> 00:01:42,519
I'm already satisfied

29
00:01:42,680 --> 00:01:43,480
to have reached this level.

30
00:01:44,480 --> 00:01:45,000
What?

31
00:01:45,079 --> 00:01:45,920
Satisfied?

32
00:01:47,040 --> 00:01:47,879
Don't say that!

33
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:48,799
Ptooey!

34
00:01:48,959 --> 00:01:49,799
Bad words don't count.
Only good ones do.

35
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:52,799
You can't be satisfied now!

36
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:54,040
Remember,

37
00:01:54,519 --> 00:01:55,920
you have extraordinary talent.

38
00:01:56,159 --> 00:01:59,040
You must seize every opportunity

39
00:01:59,159 --> 00:02:00,599
to make yourself stronger

40
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:02,560
and put yourself beyond defeat!

41
00:02:02,799 --> 00:02:03,519
Understand?

42
00:02:04,239 --> 00:02:06,439
Isn't the whole point of cultivation
to grow stronger?

43
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:07,560
Of course I understand that.

44
00:02:10,879 --> 00:02:12,360
Look at that relaxed face

45
00:02:12,439 --> 00:02:13,759
and that cheeky grin.

46
00:02:14,159 --> 00:02:15,039
You don't understand.

47
00:02:15,639 --> 00:02:16,800
You still don't.

48
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:18,639
How about

49
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:21,639
I give you four more words?

50
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:23,039
And they are:

51
00:02:24,639 --> 00:02:27,120
By any means necessary!

52
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:35,360
What a strange old man.

53
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:38,560
(Tianxuan Kingdom)

54
00:02:43,039 --> 00:02:44,479
Still running, huh?

55
00:02:45,199 --> 00:02:46,680
You really think you can get away?

56
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:48,919
Venerable!

57
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:51,000
Please spare me and my daughter!

58
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:52,319
We were wrong!

59
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:55,719
When your man insulted me two days ago,

60
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:57,680
you should've known this was coming!

61
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:59,439
He didn't know you were a Venerable!

62
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:00,400
Besides,

63
00:03:00,599 --> 00:03:02,120
you were trying to force yourself on me.

64
00:03:02,639 --> 00:03:04,879
He only fought back to protect us.

65
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:06,919
And you've already killed him.

66
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,919
Please, spare me and my daughter!

67
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:09,479
Please!

68
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:10,120
No way!

69
00:03:11,439 --> 00:03:13,199
You can either kill yourself,

70
00:03:14,919 --> 00:03:15,879
or...

71
00:03:16,719 --> 00:03:18,879
kill your own child with your own hands.

72
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:24,240
Then I'll let you live.

73
00:03:29,719 --> 00:03:30,639
What now?

74
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:31,960
That poor child.

75
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:32,879
Please, someone...

76
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:35,599
Can anyone save us?

77
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:37,439
They had the bad luck

78
00:03:37,520 --> 00:03:39,159
to cross a cultivator.

79
00:03:39,319 --> 00:03:41,159
Folks like us can't do a thing

80
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:42,599
to help.

81
00:03:42,680 --> 00:03:43,960
My patience is running thin.

82
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:45,919
I'll count to three!

83
00:03:47,039 --> 00:03:47,520
One...

84
00:03:49,599 --> 00:03:50,680
Two...

85
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:08,240
Mother...

86
00:04:09,199 --> 00:04:10,759
Mother!

87
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:16,759
Mother!

88
00:04:17,519 --> 00:04:18,959
So annoying!

89
00:04:20,319 --> 00:04:21,160
Mother!

90
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:22,360
Stop!

91
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:35,759
Mind your own business!

92
00:04:48,839 --> 00:04:49,959
Are all of you even human?

93
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:52,759
You're all just standing there
watching her mother get killed!

94
00:04:52,879 --> 00:04:54,199
But... Venerable.

95
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:55,800
We're just ordinary folks.

96
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:57,639
We can't beat a cultivator like him.

97
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:59,360
If we stepped in,

98
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:01,519
we'd die too.

99
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:05,240
It's survival of the fittest?

100
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:07,240
A cultivator in the
Spirit Awakening Realm

101
00:05:08,279 --> 00:05:10,319
can act with such impunity.

102
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,240
Is this world

103
00:05:14,079 --> 00:05:15,680
really that cruel and fragile?

104
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:17,439
Mother...

105
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:21,120
Mother, wake up!

106
00:05:23,319 --> 00:05:24,199
Mother...

107
00:05:24,839 --> 00:05:26,879
Wake up, Mother...

108
00:05:26,879 --> 00:05:28,000
Sir.

109
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:30,680
He's talking to you!

110
00:05:30,759 --> 00:05:31,680
He's talking to you! Go...

111
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:32,399
Go!

112
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:38,959
Here are two spirit crystals.

113
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:41,079
One is enough to raise her.

114
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:42,519
The other is your payment.

115
00:05:43,279 --> 00:05:44,319
Please take good care of her.

116
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:46,600
Okay.

117
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:49,480
Don't worry, Venerable.

118
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:50,920
I'll take good care of her.

119
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:56,079
Mother...

120
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:57,319
Mother...

121
00:06:04,199 --> 00:06:05,240
Come on, little girl.

122
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:07,600
Let's go.

123
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:10,199
(Lin Manor)

124
00:06:10,199 --> 00:06:12,439
(Our family has held an ancient
sword relic for generations.)

125
00:06:12,839 --> 00:06:15,240
(The Lin family coveted our legacy
and the fortune tied to our estate,)

126
00:06:15,519 --> 00:06:17,800
(Lin Manor)
(They secretly joined our enemies.)

127
00:06:17,959 --> 00:06:20,040
(They framed the Zhao family.
My parents were falsely accused.)

128
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:21,319
(They were persecuted
and died unjustly.)

129
00:06:21,639 --> 00:06:23,480
(Auspicious Omens)
(When our family fell,)

130
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:25,199
(the Lins seized our estate)

131
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:27,120
(and took all our assets.)

132
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:29,040
It's time to take back my family home.

133
00:06:31,279 --> 00:06:32,040
Who are you?

134
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:33,000
State your name!

135
00:06:35,760 --> 00:06:36,680
(Lin Manor)

136
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:46,399
Get lost!

137
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:56,360
Who are you?

138
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,439
How dare you cause trouble here?

139
00:06:57,879 --> 00:06:58,879
Give me a good reason,

140
00:06:59,079 --> 00:06:59,800
or you'll pay for this!

141
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:02,560
Tell whoever's inside to come out!

142
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:04,000
That's some big talk!

143
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:08,160
Stop!

144
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:16,800
(Lin Hong, Lin Family Patriarch)
May I ask

145
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:17,800
what brings you here,

146
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:18,920
young sir?

147
00:07:19,839 --> 00:07:21,920
(He's well-dressed and imposing,)

148
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:24,439
(maybe from some noble house.)

149
00:07:25,279 --> 00:07:26,560
(How did we offend him?)

150
00:07:26,879 --> 00:07:28,439
I'm Zhao Feiyang,
Patriarch of the Zhao family.

151
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:31,319
I've come to reclaim my family home.

152
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:35,279
So it's you.

153
00:07:35,639 --> 00:07:36,959
I wondered who it was.

154
00:07:39,079 --> 00:07:39,839
Zhao Feiyang,

155
00:07:40,319 --> 00:07:42,160
the Zhao family is long gone.

156
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:43,439
Even this estate

157
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:45,000
now belongs to us.

158
00:07:45,439 --> 00:07:47,160
Out of pity for your situation,

159
00:07:47,319 --> 00:07:48,360
leave now,

160
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:49,639
and I'll let your offense slide.

161
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:50,800
My lord,

162
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:52,000
(Dujuan, Wife of the Lin Patriarch)
you're far too kind.

163
00:07:52,319 --> 00:07:53,920
Since he had the nerve to come here
and cause trouble,

164
00:07:54,279 --> 00:07:56,279
we should teach him a lesson!

165
00:07:56,879 --> 00:07:57,399
That's hardly proper.

166
00:07:57,839 --> 00:07:58,879
After all,

167
00:07:59,319 --> 00:08:02,319
Zhao Qin, the Zhao family patriarch,
was an old friend of mine.

168
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:04,399
How could I bully his son?

169
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:05,560
Did you hear that?

170
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:06,959
My lord has spoken.

171
00:08:07,079 --> 00:08:08,120
Get lost now.

172
00:08:08,319 --> 00:08:09,879
We'll even forgive your insolence.

173
00:08:11,279 --> 00:08:12,040
Forgive me?

174
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:13,680
Then let me tell you this.

175
00:08:14,079 --> 00:08:15,439
I'll give you twenty minutes.

176
00:08:15,759 --> 00:08:17,560
If you pack up and leave at once,

177
00:08:17,879 --> 00:08:18,680
I'll forgive you

178
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:21,360
for occupying my estate
for the past three years.

179
00:08:22,040 --> 00:08:23,759
That's some big talk, Zhao Feiyang.

180
00:08:24,199 --> 00:08:25,439
Don't think I don't know

181
00:08:25,839 --> 00:08:27,920
you've been expelled from the
Heavenly Sword Sect.

182
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:30,199
No one's backing you now.

183
00:08:30,519 --> 00:08:32,039
All alone,

184
00:08:32,159 --> 00:08:33,840
you still dare bark at me?

185
00:08:34,039 --> 00:08:36,399
Looks like I don't need to show
your father any respect anymore.

186
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:37,559
Beat him!

187
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:38,759
I don't care if he lives or dies!

188
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:52,639
You...

189
00:08:53,279 --> 00:08:54,679
you started cultivating again?

190
00:08:55,519 --> 00:08:57,080
Wasn't your Dao Bone already ripped out?

191
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:58,120
Sorry to disappoint you.

192
00:08:58,639 --> 00:08:59,639
Now get lost!

193
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:01,159
How arrogant.

194
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:04,080
Do you know I'm at Stage 8
of the Spirit Awakening Realm?

195
00:09:04,399 --> 00:09:06,360
Even if you've started over,

196
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:07,840
there's no way

197
00:09:08,039 --> 00:09:09,639
you could beat me in such a short time.

198
00:09:10,399 --> 00:09:11,440
Since you asked for it,

199
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:13,919
I'll deal with you myself!

200
00:09:29,120 --> 00:09:32,320
My Collapsing Fist has reached
minor mastery.

201
00:09:32,559 --> 00:09:33,279
What a shame.

202
00:09:33,480 --> 00:09:35,600
Those meridians
you worked so hard to repair

203
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:36,840
will be ruined again.

204
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:46,759
My lord!

205
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:47,960
My lord!

206
00:09:48,279 --> 00:09:48,840
Are you all right?

207
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:50,600
My...

208
00:09:50,639 --> 00:09:51,919
my meridians are severed.

209
00:09:52,240 --> 00:09:53,000
Zhao Feiyang,

210
00:09:53,399 --> 00:09:54,279
my son Lin Xuan

211
00:09:54,600 --> 00:09:55,960
is now the chief disciple

212
00:09:56,039 --> 00:09:57,279
of the Heavenly Sword Sect.

213
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:58,639
He sent word two days ago

214
00:09:59,000 --> 00:10:00,399
that he's reached
the Spirit Burst Realm.

215
00:10:00,759 --> 00:10:01,840
How dare you hurt his father?

216
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:03,519
You've got some nerve!

217
00:10:03,679 --> 00:10:06,039
Lin Xuan is already the chief disciple?

218
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:07,279
It figures.

219
00:10:07,679 --> 00:10:09,240
Even Cuihua has become
the young sect master.

220
00:10:09,519 --> 00:10:10,840
It's no surprise
he's the chief disciple.

221
00:10:11,559 --> 00:10:12,480
In that case,

222
00:10:14,039 --> 00:10:15,919
I'll give you time to call him back.

223
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:18,639
I'll wait right here.

224
00:10:26,960 --> 00:10:30,440
♪I once stood on high,
drawing spiritual energy into my blade♪

225
00:10:30,840 --> 00:10:33,440
♪I laughed, pointing at the stars,
young and fearless♪

226
00:10:33,680 --> 00:10:37,080
♪Then came my fall,
with frost and snow on my shoulders♪

227
00:10:37,400 --> 00:10:41,000
♪My Dao foundation was damaged,
yet my Dao heart never wavered♪

228
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:45,280
♪I crossed countless peaks
to find my answer again♪

229
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:48,360
♪Through endless trials,
my Nascent Soul came♪

230
00:10:48,800 --> 00:10:51,880
♪Heaven and earth my furnace,
I rose from the flame♪

231
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:56,040
♪No sword in hand,
yet numberless blades obey♪

232
00:10:57,160 --> 00:11:00,040
♪I seek the Dao beyond the clouds♪

233
00:11:00,480 --> 00:11:03,520
♪Unafraid of countless trials♪

234
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:06,760
♪With this flesh and soul♪

235
00:11:07,160 --> 00:11:10,120
♪I shall forge a new age♪

236
00:11:10,520 --> 00:11:13,400
♪Let thunder and fire crown me♪

237
00:11:13,800 --> 00:11:16,840
♪Let wind and clouds heed me♪

238
00:11:17,280 --> 00:11:19,400
♪At cultivation's peak♪

239
00:11:19,880 --> 00:11:22,120
♪My first resolve remains unchanged♪

240
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:26,520
♪The sun and moon turn♪

241
00:11:26,960 --> 00:11:29,920
♪I hear the Great Dao ring♪

242
00:11:30,640 --> 00:11:35,400
♪I am the undying flame♪

243
00:11:38,120 --> 00:11:41,840
♪Looking back when dust settles♪

244
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:45,160
♪At last I see, immortality♪

245
00:11:46,560 --> 00:11:50,000
♪Lives in your smiles♪
